   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Liberty**: rare: 13 archived performances [4]\n- **Promised Land**: rare: 8 archived performances [4]\n- **Lovelight**: rare: 9 archived performances [4]\n- **Bobby Rocks The Vote #QueenCity**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **dc2016-06-10.dc2016-06-10.xyh5.aud.flac2496** (recommended): audience recording; 16 songs; 176 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **dc2016-06-10.dc2016-06-10.xyh5.aud.flac2496**: taped by Graham Skardon; transferred by Graham Skardon; source: AUD @ 24/96 [1]. Also: Taper clipped the recorder to a stand shared with Chris Davis, Hypnocracy and Team Dirty South, placed dead center in a good spot [1]",
